  "body": "### Summary\nThe MP storage stays in Réglages, as in legacy. Only the « MP multiples → dark topic » function becomes an experimental option, explained by a line of text under its switch.\n\n### Decision (operator, 2026-11-17, point F)\n« On laisse stockage MP dans les settings, actif par défaut. On bouge juste le switch « dark topic » dans Expérimental. Sur cet élément on supprime le (i) de l'infobulle et on met juste une description sous le switch (comme les autres descriptions). »\n\n### Today (dev-swift)\n- `App/SwiftHFR/MPStorage/MPStorageSettingsSection.swift`: one switch « Activer le stockage MP » (legacy `mpstorage_active`). Behind the experimental option « Stockage MP détaillé » (#859, `mpStorageSwitches`), there is one switch per function, each with an ⓘ popover (`MPStorageFunctionInfo`): « Liste noire partagée », « Favoris de messages », « MP multiples → dark topic ».\n\n### Scope\n1. Réglages › Stockage MP keeps the single switch « Activer le stockage MP » with legacy's behaviour.\n2. The « MP multiples → dark topic » function becomes its own experimental option in Réglages › Expérimental. Its toggle has a description underneath, in the same style as the other experimental descriptions, and **no ⓘ** and no popover.\n3. The per-function option of #859 (« Stockage MP détaillé ») is replaced by this one option. Remove its other switches and their popovers. Code stays in `App/SwiftHFR/Experimental/<Option>/` with `// EXPERIMENTAL(<option>, #<this issue>)` markers.\n4. Persistence: a member who had the #859 option on keeps their dark-topic choice. Use tolerant decoding, and remove the stale keys only after migrating them.\n\n### To clarify before coding\n« Actif par défaut »: legacy asks the member before it creates the storage message on the account (`MPStorageSyncModel.creationQuestion`). Turning it on with no question would write a private message on the forum without the member's consent. The issue keeps legacy's question unless the operator states otherwise. cloud/orch asked the operator on 2026-11-17.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Réglages › Stockage MP: a single switch, no ⓘ.\n- [ ] Réglages › Expérimental: « MP multiples → dark topic » with a description underneath, off by default.\n- [ ] Tests for the setting migration and for the default value.\n\n### Related\n#859, #903, GAP rows for MP storage (update through `### Ledger` if one changes).",
