   "updated_at": "2026-11-17T09:53:05Z",
   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-17), relayed by cloud/orch, settles « To clarify before coding »:**\n- Legacy's question before the storage message is created stays, with **« Oui » preselected by default**.\n- If the member deselects it, a **confirmation popup** explains what is lost without MP storage: the shared blacklist, the message bookmarks and the « MP multiples → dark topic » function (word it from `MPStorageFunctionInfo`). The member then confirms or goes back.\n- Never create the storage message without the member's « Oui ».\n\nTests: the default selection; the popup on deselection; no write without « Oui ».\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
